WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
The work makes three contributions.

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:08.009
It introduces a new paradigm that leverages a large
vision-language model together with

00:00:08.089 --> 00:00:12.053
external human reasoning knowledge learned from
online games,

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:15.832
enabling geo-localization that comes with an explanation.

00:00:15.912 --> 00:00:18.418
It defines the concept of locatability,

00:00:18.498 --> 00:00:21.666
a metric for how findable an image's location is,

00:00:21.746 --> 00:00:27.235
and builds a CLIP-based network to compute it,
which drives the curation of a clean,

00:00:27.315 --> 00:00:28.959
high-quality training set.

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:31.280
And it delivers GeoReasoner itself,

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:38.440
a model that beats existing geo-localization
systems while offering detailed reasoning for every prediction.
